  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE ME</p><h2 id="about-title">Lagos will always<br />be part of the story.</h2></div>
    <div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">I grew up in Lagos, moved to Canada at 18, and now call San Francisco home.</p><p>I studied software engineering at the University of Ottawa. Since then, I’ve worked at Morgan Stanley, Ford, and Kinaxis, helped build <a href="https://www.softwareforlove.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Software for Love</a>, and found my way into building companies.</p><p>My long-term ambition is close to home: <strong>build businesses that make Nigeria more independent.</strong> That’s what connects my interest in technology with the farms and the things I want to build next.</p><p>I enjoy mentoring people and meeting others who are curious about the world and willing to try something.</p><div class="journey" aria-label="From Lagos to Ottawa to San Francisco"><span><i class="nigeria-flag" aria-hidden="true"></i>Lagos</span><Arrow /><span>Ottawa</span><Arrow /><span>San Francisco</span></div></div>
  </div>
